      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The order always being XYZ may seem like a given, but I found reason to doubt it. For example, a rotation via euler Angles is on the order Z, X, Y https://docs.unity3d.com/2018.4/Documentation/ScriptReference/Transform.Rotate.html\nFor someone like me who's unfamiliar with how Vector3 values are used, it's enough to trip over.",
