  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-01-30T16:57:16.313Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "https://docs.unity3d.com/2018.4/Documentation/ScriptReference/Vector3-ctor.html\nJust a small Quality of Life request. I had to dig into the Unity docs to confirm that the three float inputs on the Vector3 constructor node correspond to X, Y, Z in order. If they were labeled as such they'd just be that much more usable for noobs.",
